window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Three gripping novels, three hard-hitting heroes.</b></p> <p>Go on the adventure of a lifetime with this boxed set from Dan Raxor and Tyler Bowman. When the galaxy is in peril, these heroes will do everything it takes to save the day. Full of vivid imagery, cunning and vicious opponents, deadly aliens, and gorgeous babes, this collection aims to immerse the listener in a sci-fi journey that won’t soon be forgotten.</p> <p><b><i>Are you ready to save the galaxy?</i></b></p> <p><b><i>Included in this collection:</i></b></p> <p><b><i>Galactic Ranger by Dan Raxor and Tyler Bowman</i></b></p> <p><b><i>Xeno Slayer by Dan Raxor and Tyler Bowman</i></b></p> <p><b><i>StarCutter – A Universal Mercenary by Dan Raxor</i></b></p>"; 
